@can_take_space_both = [w.both wacute.both wcircumflex.both wdieresis.both wgrave.both omega.both omegatonos.both wturned.both m.both sha-cy.both sha-cy.loclBGR.both shcha-cy.both shcha-cy.loclBGR.both psi.both mhook.both mlonglegturned.both mmiddletilde.both mturned.both ae.both aeacute.both oe.both ij.both OEsmall.both dezh.both dzaltone.both dzcurl.both fengdigraph.both lezh.both lsdigraph.both lzdigraph.both tccurl.both tesh.both ts.both em-cy.both hardsign-cy.both hardsign-cy.loclBGR.both ef-cy.both yu-cy.both yu-cy.loclBGR.both phi.both phi-latin.both zhe-cy.both zhe-cy.loclBGR.both zhedescender-cy.both yeru-cy.both lje-cy.both nje-cy.both W.both Wacute.both Wcircumflex.both Wdieresis.both Wgrave.both won.both won.nobar.both M.both Em-cy.both Mu.both T.both Tbar.both Tcaron.both Tcedilla.both Tcommaaccent.both Te-cy.both Tau.both AE.both AEacute.both OE.both De-cy.both De-cy.loclBGR.both Hardsign-cy.both Tshe-cy.both Dje-cy.both Ef-cy.both Ef-cy.loclBGR.both Phi.both Psi.both Yeru-cy.both Lje-cy.both Nje-cy.both Yu-cy.both Zhe-cy.both Zhedescender-cy.both Sha-cy.both Shcha-cy.both Epsilontonos.both Etatonos.both Iotatonos.both Omicrontonos.both Upsilontonos.both Omegatonos.both numero.both centigrade.both fahrenheit.both kelvin.both exclamationquestion.both exclamdouble.both doublequestion.both questionexclamation.both heavySingleTurnedCommaQuotationMarkOrnament.both heavySingleCommaQuotationMarkOrnament.both heavyDoubleTurnedCommaQuotationMarkOrnament.both heavyDoubleCommaQuotationMarkOrnament.both trademark.both servicemark.both percent.both perthousand.both at.both ampersand.both nAryCircledDotOperator.both nAryCircledPlusOperator.both nAryCircledTimesOperator.both APLdeldieresis.both APLdelstile.both APLdeltastile.both APLdeltaunderbar.both APLquaddel.both APLquaddelta.both colonequals.both equalsSignWithTwoDotsAboveAndTwoDotsBelow.both equalscolon.both equivalence.both equivalentWithFourDotsAbove.both gradient.both midlinehorizontalellipsis.both muchgreat